    F07 rep 4: LLM diagnosis rejected by deterministic validation: repair_permitted: proposed 'rollback_prompt', but F06 may only use 'rollback_config'; deterministic_agreement: LLM says F06, deterministic detection says F07
    F08 rep 4: LLM diagnosis rejected by deterministic validation: repair_permitted: proposed 'rollback_prompt', but F06 may only use 'rollback_config'; deterministic_agreement: LLM says F06, deterministic detection says F08
